[00:00.53]易考范文七
[00:03.93]In the picture, a man is standing in the boat,
[00:08.74]his fingers pointing to the distance.
[00:11.14]Characters in it read “scientific development”.
[00:15.08]It goes without saying that this picture intends to reveal that
[00:19.67]only in a scientific way can our nation develop rapidly.
[00:23.94]How can we ensure that we make headway in the right direction?
[00:27.99]As far as I am concerned,
[00:30.18]several factors as follows need to be taken into account.
[00:34.44]First and foremost, we should put a high premium on the public interest
[00:39.69]and devote whole-heartedly to it.
[00:42.21]That is to say, we must put the interests of the people in the first place,
[00:47.24]since the ultimate goal of the development is to
[00:50.08]provide a comfortable and happy life for people.
[00:53.47]Besides, it is an essential task to close the gap
[00:57.63]between the wealthy and the poor.
[00:59.71]In addition, seeking people's advice can
[01:02.99]prevent the government officials from isolating themselves from the masses.
[01:07.36]Last but not least, we should balance economic growth
[01:11.63]and environmental protection so as to retain rapid and sustainable development.
[01:17.43]Undoubtedly, we will be confronted with enormous work and unexpected difficulties
[01:23.33]in the course of development.
[01:25.19]We firmly believe, however,
[01:27.38]that we are heading for a brighter future as long as we do not go astray.

